I get up early in the morning.
It is six o'clock now.
Mumbai city is quiet.
I go to the kitchen.
I make hot coffee.
Now I take the cup.
I go near the window.
I look outside.
The weather is pleasant.
The birds are chirping.
Some people are walking on the street.
A dog is also walking there.
Now the sun is rising.
I drink the hot coffee.
The coffee is very tasty.
Now my day begins.
Now I am ready.
